	<section id="main-content"
		class="highlighted-text content-wrapper content-wrapper--dark bg-secondary lh-30 overflow-hidden pt-4 pt-sm-5 pb-2 pb-sm-4 override-bg override-color">
		<div  class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-lg-6">
										<h2 class="h3 text-uppercase">
						Event venue in the heart of Budapest – where ideas turn into successful events					</h2>
									</div>
				<div class="col-lg-8">
					<div class="">
						<p data-start="161" data-end="301">Conferences, corporate events, award ceremonies and exclusive evenings with full technical support, flexible spaces and an experienced team.</p>
<p data-start="303" data-end="353"><strong data-start="303" data-end="353">Why choose Akvárium Klub for corporate events?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li data-start="355" data-end="459"><strong data-start="355" data-end="375">Central location</strong><br data-start="375" data-end="378" />In downtown Budapest, easily accessible, close to multiple public transport hubs.</li>
<li data-start="461" data-end="616"><strong data-start="461" data-end="489">Flexible, modular spaces</strong><br data-start="489" data-end="492" />For events of 50–1,000 guests &#8211; from conferences to standing receptions<br data-start="563" data-end="566" />For music and dance events from 50 to 2,200 guests</li>
<li data-start="618" data-end="758"><strong data-start="618" data-end="658">Premium in-house technical solutions</strong><br data-start="658" data-end="661" />Professional sound, lighting and visual technology, LED walls, and an experienced technical crew.</li>
<li data-start="760" data-end="882"><strong data-start="760" data-end="797">Experienced event management team</strong><br data-start="797" data-end="800" />We don’t just provide a venue – we think it through with you from start to finish.</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="884" data-end="980">Request a personalized offer within 24 hours via the form below or at <span style="color: #e3e1e1;"><a style="color: #e3e1e1;" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c8bba9a4adbb88a9a3bea9baa1bda5a3a4bdaae6a0bd"><strong data-start="954" data-end="979"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="90e3f1fcf5e3d0f1fbe6f1e2f9e5fdfbfce5f2bef8e5">[email&#160;protected]</span></strong></a></span>.</p>
<p data-start="982" data-end="1036">Click here and explore Akvárium Klub: <span style="color: #e3e1e1;"><a style="color: #e3dcdc;" href="https://www.virtualtour360.hu/360/akvariumlub/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #e6e3e3;">VIRTUAL</span> TOUR</a></span></p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="row pt-4">
				<div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
					<a href="#ajanlat" class="button location-offer-button button--primary button--large js-location-button">
						Contact us					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	
    
	
    	<section  class="location-summary content-wrapper bg-grey lh-30 overflow-hidden pt-4 pb-2 pb-lg-5">
		<div  class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-lg-4 summary-wrapper my-auto">
										<h2 class="h3 text-uppercase">
						Floorplan					</h2>
					<p>Apart from Budapest’s largest terrace, Akvárium Klub consists of four halls which can be utilized individually or collectively:</p>
<ul>
<li>Main Hall</li>
<li>Small Hall</li>
<li>Lokál</li>
<li>Aranyhall Conference Center</li>
</ul>
<p>Total capacity of Akvárium Klub: 2100 people</p>
				</div>
