				<div class="col-lg-8">
										<div class="location-place" id="mainhall">
						<div class="location-img-wrapper">
							<img width="730" height="350" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20730%20350'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="location__img" alt="Main Hall" data-lazy-src="https://akvariumklub.hu/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/nagyhall_730_2.jpg"><noscript><img width="730" height="350" src="https://akvariumklub.hu/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/nagyhall_730_2.jpg" class="location__img" alt="Main Hall"></noscript>
							<div class="location__title">
								<h2 class="h1 text-uppercase">
									Main Hall								</h2>
							</div>
						</div>
												<div class="row">
							<div class="col-lg-7">
								<div class="location-small-recap override-bg override-color">
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Usable space:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>320 sq m</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Capacity:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>1280 people</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Seating arrangement with rows:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>430 people</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Roundtable seating arrangement:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>200 people</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Sound system:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>Martin Audio </P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Led wall:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>7 x 2.5 m</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
												<div class="content-wrapper lh-30">
							<p>Beyond its elegant and attractive design, the club&#8217;s main hall features a unique sound system and optionally configurable spatial elements. The Main Hall is the perfect venue for professional stage productions, fashion shows, major concerts, conferences, seated and gala events as well as car shows. Its unique sound system and sound insulation makes the Main Hall of Akvárium Klub one of the best concert halls in the city. The concert hall can be utilized without a sound limit!</p>
						</div>
					</div>
										<div class="location-place" id="smallhall">
						<div class="location-img-wrapper">
							<img width="730" height="350" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20730%20350'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="location__img" alt="Small Hall" data-lazy-src="https://akvariumklub.hu/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/kishall_730_2.jpg"><noscript><img width="730" height="350" src="https://akvariumklub.hu/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/kishall_730_2.jpg" class="location__img" alt="Small Hall"></noscript>
							<div class="location__title">
								<h2 class="h1 text-uppercase">
									Small Hall								</h2>
							</div>
						</div>
												<div class="row">
							<div class="col-lg-7">
								<div class="location-small-recap override-bg override-color">
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Usable space											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>230 sq m</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
										<div class="col-sm-7">
											<p class="text-semibold">
												Capacity:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>700 people</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																		<div class="row">
