											<p class="text-semibold">
												Seating arrangement with rows:											</p>
										</div>
										<div class="col-sm-5 float-right float-lg-none">
											<P>100 people</P>
										</div>
									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
												<div class="content-wrapper lh-30">
							<p>The conference center is located in a separate wing. It can be<br />
artitioned into 2 separate spaces, if needed. The facility is equipped with separate washrooms.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
									</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

		<section data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="technics-section overflow-hidden bg-grey">
		<div  class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-lg-12 text-center content-wrapper  lh-30">
					<h1 class="text-uppercase">Technical background</h1>
<p>A key element of the refurbishment of Akvárium Klub was the replacement of the entire sound system and array of visual devices. Apart from the Main Hall’s 7 x 2.5-meter LED wall and the unique lighting system, a fully equipped studio has been established at the club, which allows for the professional recording or live streaming of events. Combined with the top-quality Martin Audio sound system, these features ensure that the tour buses of well-known foreign musical productions no longer stop in Vienna and instead come to Budapest. The range of top quality devices also provides corporate events with a unique opportunity to utilize the club’s impeccable sound and visual technology.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-12  content-wrapper technics-images">
									</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="offer-section overflow-hidden" id="ajanlat" tabindex="-1">
	<div  class="container">
		<div
			class="row content-wrapper bg-secondary override-bg-secondary override-color content-wrapper--dark text-center pt-5 pb-4">
			<div class="col-lg-6 mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-uppercase mb-lg-4">
					Write us a message to request an offer				</h2>

				<form method="POST" role="form" class="offer-form" id="offer-form">
